https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112312","id":3477839306,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7PS53K","user":{"login":"DexterFstone","id":92402263,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYHyVw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92402263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone","html_url":"https://github.com/DexterFstone","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-02T10:18:31Z","updated_at":"2025-11-02T10:18:31Z","body":"> Sounds like this [documented limitation](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/scripting/resources.html#creating-your-own-resources)\n\nSo why only happen if I use an inner class and not the global class? What is the difference?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3477839306/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3477841147","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112312#issuecomment-3477841147","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112312","id":3477841147,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7PS6T7","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-02T10:20:14Z","updated_at":"2025-11-02T10:20:14Z","body":"See the documentation linked, it describes why (which matches the error message), there's no path to the class as it doesn't have a file of its own ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3477841147/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3477971908","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112312#issuecomment-3477971908","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112312","id":3477971908,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7PTaPE","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-02T13:41:09Z","updated_at":"2025-11-02T13:41:09Z","body":"> What is the difference?\n\nWe currently don't have a unified type system or at least a unified FQTN representation (fully qualified type name). Built-in types, `ClassDB` classes, and scripts (both unnamed and global) are all different layers of types, each handled differently. Some engine and GDScript features (built-in scripts, inner classes, runtime scripts) don't fit into any classification at all, as they lack not only a global name but even a unique file path.\n\nAnd since `JSON.from_native()` is a core method, it can't know anything about GDScript's internals. Unlike `inst_to_dict()`, which was deprecated due to other issues.\n\nCertain efforts are being made to unify the type system, but it's a long and complex process. Currently, unfortunately, you either have to avoid using certain engine/language features that aren't fully supported, or implement a custom serialization system that meets your needs.\n\nAlso note that none of the existing built-in serialization systems are safe for objects (when you use `allow_objects = true`). This is important if you are deserializing data from untrusted sources.\n\n* See also https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12300.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3477971908/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]